meta {
  name: Delete My Account
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/users/me
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  # Delete My Account

  Soft deletes the current user's account.

  ## Authentication Required
  - Yes (Bearer token)

  ## Behavior
  - Sets `deleted_at` timestamp
  - Account is hidden from all queries
  - User data retained for 30-day recovery period
  - Permanent deletion occurs after 30 days (via cleanup job)

  ## Effects on Related Data
  - **Trips created by user**: Set `created_by` to NULL (public trips persist)
  - **Private trips**: Hidden (will be permanently deleted after 30 days)
  - **Trip days**: Deleted when trip is permanently deleted

  ## Response
  - 204 No Content (success)

  ## Recovery
  - User can contact support within 30 days to restore account
  - After 30 days, data is permanently deleted

  ## Warning
  This action marks the account for deletion. Use with caution.
}
